{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For I will be with you, and this is your sign.</b> That you will decree and it will be established — וְיָקֻם לָךְ (Job 22:28) — wherever you turn, and through this all will recognize that I have sent you and will hold you and your words in esteem, as in: גַּם הָאִיש מֹשֶׁה גָּדוֹל מְאֹד בְּאֶרֶץ מִצְרָיִם (Exodus 11:3)." "<b>When you bring the people out of Egypt, you shall serve Elohim on this mountain.</b> Even though they are not worthy, they are prepared to serve Elohim on this mountain when you bring them out from among the wicked."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:11.422114796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}